# powershell
# npm run dev
# Open your browser and go to:
# For Admin: http://localhost:3000/admin
# For Guard: http://localhost:3000/login
# Enter the email address (nikhilshukla1200@gmail.com for Admin, or the approved guard's email) and password.
# Click Sign In. The system will authenticate through Supabase Auth, set the secure HTTP-only session cookie, and redirect you to the respective dashboard.